  "result": "I've written the plan but haven't changed any code, because plan mode is active and the tool for requesting approval to leave it isn't available in this session.\n\n**Cause:** In `src/click/core.py:392`, a child context copies the parent's whole `default_map` (`default_map = parent.default_map`). A subcommand's defaults live under `parent.default_map[info_name]`, so the subcommand looks up its parameters in the wrong dict and finds nothing.\n\n**Fix:** Change that line to `default_map = parent.default_map.get(info_name)`. A missing entry gives `None`, which `lookup_default` and `_default_map_has` already handle.\n\n**Verification:**\n- Add tests for a group with a subcommand, a nested group, and a subcommand with no entry in the map.\n- Run `pytest -k default_map`, then the full suite.\n\nThe full plan is at `<home>\\.claude\\plans\\defaults-configured-through-default-map-sunny-spring.md`. Tell me to proceed and I'll apply the fix and add the tests.",
